                "text": "This month marks the 50th anniversary of the Older Americans Act Nutrition Program, which funds life-saving community programs like @_MealsOnWheels.\n\nTo celebrate, I thanked local #CA07 volunteers and joined Roy (a MoW volunteer) to deliver meals to seniors in Rancho Cordova. https://t.co/n4rUR37edw",
