                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "In the face of relentless attacks on women\u2019s health care by Republicans across the country, today\u2019s decision will eliminate barriers to contraceptive access, empower women to exercise autonomy over their family planning decisions, and improve the economic well-being of millions.",
