                "reply_count": 19,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "There will be real consequences for the American people if our government experiences a long-term shutdown in three days:\n\n\u274cWorking families will lose access to nutrition assistance\n\u274cStalled research on diseases like cancer and Alzheimer\u2019s\n\u274cServicemembers will not receive pay",
