                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "On #ThxBirthControl Day, I proudly stand with women nationwide in the ongoing fight for reproductive health care.\n\nAmidst efforts by Republicans to restrict access to birth control, we must empower women to exercise autonomy over their futures - free from political interference.",
