                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Part of why I became a doctor\u2014and why I\u2019ve fought so hard for global health and nutrition in Congress\u2014is because images like this have stayed with me since I was a kid.\n\u00a0\nI asked Secretary Rubio to commit to providing food aid to those who depend on it around the world.\n\u00a0\nNo other nation can do what America does. We must continue to lead.",
